 hungrier than ever! I have completely rebuilt the tutorial to make sure beginners can grasp the concept of the game more easily. It is now also suitable for players not familiar with automation games. On the reworked end screen, you can now read your run's statistics and an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:58:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1842846814455346","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"announcement","title":"Vena Release Date Announced & Many Bundles Coming!","summary":"I have some exciting news to share with you. If you haven't heard it yet, Vena will release on November 9th, a bit after the participation in Steam Next Fest. There will be a few bundles coming along with the release. As many of you love the soundtrack of the game, there will be a \"Soundtrack Enjoyer Edition\" bundle, where in addition to the game, you get all 7 original tracks that define the game's unique atmosphere in highest FLAC quality to listen anywhere, anytime. From atmospheric soundscap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T11:13:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1841579228668762","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"announcement","title":"Vena takes part in the Best Indie Games Fall Showcase 2026","summary":"Hey everyone,I have good news to share about Vena! Mark your calendars for September 1st, because Vena was accepted for the Best Indie Games Fall Showcase 2026, where the official release date will be announced! It will premiere on Clemmy Games' Youtube channel.Behind the scenes, constant development hasn't stopped. As I gear up for the Steam Next Fest this October, here is a quick update on where things are at:I am in the final stages of polishing the game to make sure everything feels perfect ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T13:28:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1834602721197052","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"announcement","title":"Vena at the Deutsche Indie Showcase: New Trailer and Release Window Announced!","summary":"Hello everyone,The Deutsche Indie Showcase - Summer Game Fest Edition 2026 is kicking off right now, and I'm incredibly excited to finally share that Vena is part of the lineup.Every game selected for the showcase received the Deutsche Indie Showcase Choice Award, and it feels great to be able to display it alongside so many other brilliant indie projects. To celebrate the event, I have a few major updates to share with you all today.Brand New Trailer & Release WindowI am debuting a brand new tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T21:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197052","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1833968530889499","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"update","title":"Vena is part of the Strategems Event & Demo Update!","summary":"I am thrilled to announce that Vena is part of the Strategems 2026 festival!A huge thank you to the team behind the event for the opportunity to be featured alongside so many amazing strategy games. You can check out the event and grab some great games here:https://store.steampowered.com/curator/46073222/sale/strategems2026Demo UpdateTo celebrate, I’ve released a small demo update featuring a few things I’ve been working on:Better game-to-player communicationA stronger focus on clarity in the tu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T21:22:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530889499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1823825466500922","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"announcement","title":"The Vena Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello everyone!The day has finally arrived. The Vena Demo is available to play right now!Releasing this demo is a huge milestone for me, and I wanted to take a moment to look back at how we got here. It’s been a crazy journey from a small game jam entry to a full Steam page, and I couldn't have done it without you.Back in September 2025, I entered Godot Wild Jam #85 with a simple idea for the theme \"Expansion.\" I had 9 days to build something from scratch. That little prototype was called World ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T23:36:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466500922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4165740-1821288646586240","game_id":"steam-4165740","kind":"update","title":"Hello from the Developer! Demo News & Progress Update","summary":"Hello everyone!I wanted to share a quick update on how Vena is progressing. Development has been moving fast, and I'm currently polishing the core gameplay loop to make everything feel satisfying. The demo release is getting closer, and localization is a milestone that is important for me to be completed beforehand.I also want to say welcome to my Asian audience! Vena has been getting coverage from Famitsu and gamer.com.tw, which introduced a lot of excited gamers to it. I will make sure to inte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-12T16:39:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646586240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4165740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4165740":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4165740":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z"},"4202120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:00Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4165740","app_id":4165740,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"310d6884422cf5c77859dc568232b21c3af991aef1e51a863079593ac0b30584","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"런 한 판이 한 세션에 끝나는 자동화 로그라이크입니다. 육각 타일을 배치해 생산하는 유기체를 키우세요. 그동안 자원 수요는 시간이 갈수록 늘어납니다. 상점에서 주사위를 굴려 타일을 더 사들이고, 규칙을 바꾸는 특전을 골라 경제를 완전히 무너뜨려 보세요.","publishers":[{"name":"loerting"}],"developers":[{"name":"loerting"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794246900,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Vena Release Window Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1786916424","trailer_c